      "category": "Table",
      "text": "<table><thead><tr><th>Agency</th><th>Project Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1. City Planning Commission</td><td>a. Private development with zoning change, map change, or special permit.<br>b. Programs with Federal, State or City funding.<br>c. City housing and park mapping.</td></tr><tr><td>2. Site Selection Board</td><td>a. City projects (except housing and parks).<br>b. Waterfront Construction (city).</td></tr><tr><td>3. Ports and Terminals</td><td>Waterfront Construction (private).</td></tr><tr><td>4. Dept. of Buildings</td><td>Private development without zoning variance.</td></tr><tr><td>5. Board of Standards and Appeals</td><td>Private development with zoning variance.</td></tr><tr><td>6. Transportation Administration</td><td>a. Subway and bus routes.<br>b. Mapping or designation of right-of-way of highways.</td></tr><tr><td>7. Landmarks Commission</td><td>Landmark site.</td></tr><tr><td>8. Office of the Mayor Development Offices</td><td>Recommendation to the Mayor on any of the above project types.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
